n\n      <p class=\"line\">（3）根据图形的特点，把它分成几个长方形。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">面积分别为：<span class=\"blue\">[?]、[?]、[?]</span></p>\n      <p class=\"line\">合起来就是整个图形的面积。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n\n      <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">边长相等的部分可以合并计算。</span></p>\n      <p class=\"line\">5. 解决问题。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">一块长方形菜地，长 [?] 米，宽 [?] 米。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">这块菜地的面积是多少平方米？</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">解：<span class=\"boxed\">[?] × [?] = [?]（平方米）</span></p>\n      <p class=\"line\">答：这块菜地的面积是 [?] 平方米。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page right-page\">\n      <p class=\"line\">（二）在括号里填上合适的数。</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">把下面的数改写成用“万”作单位的数。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">[?] 万 = [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">[?] 万 = [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">（2）先估一估，再计算。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">① [?] × [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">② [?] × [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">积的末尾有几个零，要根据因数来判断。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"note-box\">\n        <div class=\"title\">书写方法</div>\n        <div>先确定数位，再从高位写起。</div>\n        <div>每一位上的数字要对齐。</div>\n        <div class=\"red\">不要漏写零。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"line\">（3）计算下面各题。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">[?] + [?] = [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">[?] - [?] = [?]</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">[?] × [?] = [?]</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: boxed calculation layout]</div>\n\n      <p class=\"line\">2. 解决问题。</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">学校买来一些图书，平均分给几个班。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">每班分得 [?] 本，一共分给 [?] 个班。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">一共有多少本图书？</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">解：<span class=\"boxed\">[?] × [?] = [?]（本）</span></p>\n      <p class=\"line\">答：一共有 [?] 本图书。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"line large-gap\">（4）填空。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">一个数由 [?] 个万和 [?] 个一组成。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">这个数写作：<span class=\"red-box\">[?]</span></p>\n      <p class=\"line\">读数